---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Submit a Tool or Update — NeoMBSE" description="Submit a UML or SysML tool, version update, source, or correction for editorial review.">
  <article class="section container narrow prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contribute evidence</p>
    <h1>Submit a tool or update.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Vendors, maintainers, and users can propose new tools, corrections, version changes, and supporting sources. All submissions are reviewed before publication.</p>
    <h2>What to include</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Tool name and official website.</li>
      <li>The exact claim or field that should be added or changed.</li>
      <li>A link to current official documentation, release notes, or another primary source.</li>
      <li>The relevant product version or edition.</li>
      <li>Your relationship to the tool, if any.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Editorial policy</h2>
    <p>A submission does not guarantee publication. Evidence is assessed using the <a href="/methodology/">NeoMBSE verification methodology</a>. Sponsored relationships do not determine technical findings.</p>
  </article>
</MainLayout>
